 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Talk",
   "texto": [
    "**Falar** is «talk.» and is a regular verb in -ar: phalas, phalas, fala, fallamos, phalam.",
    "**Falas português?** = You speak Portuguese? **Falo um pouco** = I talk a little. **Não falo francês** = I don't speak French.",
    "The languages are written with a small: Portuguese, Spanish, French, German. **Língua** is «language»."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Living",
   "texto": [
    "To say where you live, **morar** is used: moro, moras, mora, moramos, moram.",
    "**Onde moras?** = where do you live? **Moro em Lisboa** = I live in Lisbon."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Personal data",
   "texto": [
    "In a file you can find **morada** (address) and **código postal**. The address usually includes the name of the street, the door number and the town."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "In, in",
   "texto": [
    "«Em» is also merged with the articles: em + or = **no**, em + a = **na**.",
    "With cities and countries without articles, only **em**: Moro **em** Lisbon. Moro **em** Espanha.",
    "With article: Moro **no** Porto. Moro **no** Brazil. Moro **no** center (in the center). Moro **na** cidade."
   ]
  },
